Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.95,0:00:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just surprising to me\Nthat you can't swim, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never had a reason to swim\Nin the other world.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.96,0:00:31.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,'Cause I could do this.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.16,0:00:35.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magic?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.03,0:00:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You aren't allowed to use magic!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.66,0:00:39.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously? But it makes things easier.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.09,0:00:41.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll attract attention! Get down here!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.39,0:00:45.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eek, Hinata! Catch me!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh! Hinata, you dog.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.64,0:00:51.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell! Fix your swimsuit!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.28,0:02:00.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.01,0:02:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're such a pain, I swear...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.88,0:02:05.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magic is off limits for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.09,0:02:06.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.64,0:02:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With one of these,\Nit doesn't even matter if you can swim!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.71,0:02:13.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll have just as much fun\Nusing a floatie instead of magic!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.15,0:02:14.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura...!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.60,0:02:16.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.09,0:02:41.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.16,0:02:42.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a dolphin!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.20,0:02:43.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.54,0:02:50.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look at the camera! Say cheese!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.74,0:02:54.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara! Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.15,0:02:57.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.47,0:02:59.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. I've got my life jacket.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.40,0:03:02.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you weren't hurt.\NY'know, since you can't swim.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.91,0:03:04.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.44,0:03:07.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're always coming to my rescue.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.66,0:03:10.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really are my hero, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.87,0:03:13.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell? C'mon, you're way too close—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.89,0:03:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh please, this is nothing.\NIf you and I were to—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you two okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.00,0:03:38.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! Now that Bell's\Ngotten used to the ocean...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,wanna have another race?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.86,0:03:41.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.78,0:03:43.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.26,0:03:46.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, I want to see you look cool\Nout there in the water.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.94,0:03:51.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.31,0:03:52.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.30,0:03:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cecil takes the lead!\NHinata's right on her tail!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.25,0:03:59.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't stop! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You alright?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.08,0:04:04.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Racing with a floatie kinda sucks...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.78,0:04:07.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The dolphin we saw earlier?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.81,0:04:10.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd expect nothing less, Lord Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.09,0:04:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I won't lose!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.63,0:04:12.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Neither will I!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.09,0:04:17.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.46,0:04:20.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First place!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.05,0:04:21.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, what an upset!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.85,0:04:23.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The winner is Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.69,0:04:25.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A dolphin?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.39,0:04:26.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.70,0:04:29.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Direct all your complaints to the dolphin.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.46,0:04:32.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Talk about raining on our parade...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.12,0:04:39.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Cecil?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.20,0:04:40.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn fish...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.41,0:04:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's a naughty little rascal, isn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.83,0:04:44.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.21,0:04:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He stole Lady Sakura's swimsuit!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.92,0:04:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seems like he just wants to play.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.00,0:04:58.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.72,0:05:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.05,0:05:05.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've got to get Sakura's swimsuit back!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.49,0:05:06.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.35,0:05:09.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? You're seriously gonna tell me\Nnot to use my magic?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.90,0:05:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On the contrary. Cast it on us, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.29,0:05:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our target is the dolphin!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.00,0:05:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our objective is securing the swimsuit!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.04,0:05:26.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, this brings back memories!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now let's get moving!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.43,0:05:33.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Water spirits, lend me your power!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.34,0:05:38.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, didn't mean to scare you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.34,0:05:40.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But my friend really needs that back.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.82,0:05:43.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.47,0:05:45.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excellent job, Lord Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.32,0:05:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, can you not wave it around like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.12,0:05:55.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's already getting late.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.10,0:05:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe we oughtta pack it in.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.88,0:06:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I got some great footage.\NCan't wait to edit it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.08,0:06:02.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, let's go explore over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait a minute, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.03,0:06:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to head home, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.08,0:06:09.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? In that case, we'll go with—
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.97,0:06:12.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't there something\Nyou need to talk to Bell about?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.48,0:06:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'see, I... came to a realization recently.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.17,0:06:25.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You two are always so cheerful and caring,\Nand it makes me happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.01,0:06:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.43,0:06:32.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...good luck!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.40,0:06:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.22,0:06:46.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,God, I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.26,0:06:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A piece of coral.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.91,0:06:54.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It must've washed up here.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.52,0:06:56.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May would say we should\Nput it "on the 'gram."
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.77,0:06:59.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you're learning internet slang, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.02,0:07:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.46,0:07:02.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I pick it up from being around you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.93,0:07:08.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.05,0:07:10.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.76,0:07:14.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, to be honest...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.29,0:07:19.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before I came here, all I could\Nthink about was seeing you again.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.06,0:07:23.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're still my number one priority,\Nthat hasn't changed. But...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.44,0:07:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've seen so many new things, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.17,0:07:29.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The world you call home,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.24,0:07:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've come to appreciate\Nwhat type of place it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.37,0:07:38.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,while I love you very much,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.00,0:07:39.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I also love this world!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.84,0:07:41.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I came here!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.54,0:07:48.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me, too. I'm glad you\Ncame to my world— no.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.60,0:07:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I met you, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.69,0:07:55.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.33,0:08:00.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love you, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.11,0:08:03.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose you!\NI want to be with you forever!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.14,0:08:12.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-Although, it might be tough\Nsince I'm a human
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.39,0:08:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and elves live for such a long time...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.67,0:08:17.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'll try my hardest to\Nmake sure you won't be sad—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.23,0:08:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.25,0:08:19.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.73,0:08:22.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What you said just now...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,can you say it one more time?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.63,0:08:28.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.85,0:08:31.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love you, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.04,0:09:06.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi-na-ta!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, you're way too close.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.71,0:09:11.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, where's the harm? Is it a problem?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.35,0:09:14.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I guess it's not a big deal...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.18,0:09:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,G'morning, Sunohara. G'morning, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.51,0:09:18.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.93,0:09:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mochida.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.01,0:09:56.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a great meal!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.90,0:09:59.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your cooking is delicious\Nas always, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.86,0:10:02.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.11,0:10:03.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll go ahead and clean up—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.69,0:10:05.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi-na-ta!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.52,0:10:06.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.41,0:10:08.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind having dessert, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.66,0:10:10.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dessert?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.05,0:10:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think we have some custard in the fridge—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.17,0:10:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez... That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.17,0:10:18.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you for dessert.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.12,0:10:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to\Nhold back anymore, is there?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.84,0:10:25.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But can you wait? Let me shower before—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.64,0:10:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope, no way!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.75,0:10:31.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ever since this morning— no.\NI've been waiting patiently all this time!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.07,0:10:36.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hinata...\NHow many kids do you want?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.35,0:10:37.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,K-Kids?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.39,0:10:40.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a little early to start thinking\Nabout things like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.07,0:10:41.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be naïve!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.47,0:10:45.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're constantly surrounded by\Na whole bunch of women as it is!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.25,0:10:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.91,0:10:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I can't even imagine myself\Nwith anyone except for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.86,0:10:55.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.74,0:10:58.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That settles it...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.37,0:11:00.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I already made my decision,\Nbut this drives it home!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.62,0:11:01.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.87,0:11:05.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell?! You've got that really crazy\Nlook in your eyes!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.92,0:11:07.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's your fault, y'know.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.73,0:11:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I lose all sense of reason because of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.54,0:11:11.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait—!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.73,0:11:13.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should have at least three kids, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.75,0:11:17.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't mind whether they're boys or girls,\Nbut I would like at least one girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.05,0:11:20.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, and we'll have to find a place to live!\NThis apartment is a little too small.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.55,0:11:24.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ideally, we'd have a dog or other pets,\Nand we'd be surrounded by family too, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.70,0:11:26.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, on holidays,\Nwe'll all go fishing as a family,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.81,0:11:28.47,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Sh-She's intense...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.56,0:11:29.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and at night, we'll sit down together\Nand eat a nice dinner...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.80,0:11:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A female dark elf named Mariabell.\NI met her in another world, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.75,0:11:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she's slightly obsessed with me...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.25,0:11:45.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love you, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love you too, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.17,0:11:57.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But she's a very pure-hearted girl,\Nand very cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.76,0:12:00.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.94,0:12:04.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time for dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs46\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(442,259)}The video's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs57\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(672,691)}Summer Memories
